  .overlay[data-screen='title'] .card--title { width: min(560px, 100%); }
  .hud { ... } /* maybe scale */
}
```
But overlay fixed inside stage with overflow hidden? Test.

Also stage-wrap gap now has rotate hint; the stage sits centered vertically in remaining space. Fine.

